  #line-at(192.12pt, 261.36pt, " and enabling silicon diffusion into the carbon-rich growth front. The ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 288.96pt, "diffusing Si forms a transient SiC-rich transition layer, which diminishes as carbon supersaturation ")
  #line-at(56.88pt, 316.56pt, "increases and diamond growth proceeds. As evidenced in Fig. 1(d), this process leads to a broader ")
